<title>CHINA: China starts drilling oil well on Pamir plateau.</title>
<headline>China starts drilling oil well on Pamir plateau.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China has began drilling its first oil well on the Pamir plateau in the northwestern region of Xinjiang, the Xinhua news agency said.</p>
<p>The Wuqia Oil Well 1 is the westernmost to be drilled by Chinese oil companies and is due to be completed by July 1 this year, the agency said.</p>
<p>It gave no details of expected production from the well in Wuqia county or estimated reserves.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
